# Android JNI Libraries Directory

This directory contains pre-built llama.cpp native libraries for Android.

## Directory Structure

```
jniLibs/
├── arm64-v8a/
│   └── libllama.so
├── armeabi-v7a/
│   └── libllama.so
└── x86_64/
    └── libllama.so
```

## Building Libraries

Run the GitHub Actions workflow `build-llama-cpp.yml` to build all libraries.

The Android builds use the NDK to cross-compile for each ABI.
